WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.400
Every buyer moves through five stages,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.189
from the first search to a customer for life.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.584
First, be found wherever buyers look:

00:00:08.776 --> 00:00:09.917
Google, AI search,

00:00:09.937 --> 00:00:11.998
marketplaces and social.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.056
Then engage every shopper instantly,

00:00:15.076 --> 00:00:16.380
capturing every visit,

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.566
save and question.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:21.464
Turn interest into action:

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:22.459
Mike gets the lead,

00:00:22.479 --> 00:00:24.807
with the whole story.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.788
After the sale,

00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:28.379
stay connected with service reminders,

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:30.019
tips and upgrades.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.590
And build customers for life,

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.995
from their first model to their next one.

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:39.889
Book a demo with DealerEdge.
